  "interpretation_zh": "在已开封 Case 5 的 546 个单元和 13 套虚拟九相机几何上，K9 至 K15 没有任何全局固定深度同时通过绝对门和相对 K16 的 matched 门。最接近的 K15 仅有 544/546 绝对单元、11/13 完整几何通过，而且 matched 仍为 0/546、0/13；K16 为 546/546、13/13。因此 K16 继续作为最低可靠的全局固定 deterministic reference。",
  "interpretation_en": "Across 546 opened Case 5 cells and 13 virtual nine-camera geometries, no globally fixed depth from K9 through K15 clears both the absolute and K16-matched gates. The closest lower depth, K15, reaches only 544/546 absolute cells and 11/13 complete geometries, while remaining at 0/546 matched cells and 0/13 matched geometries. K16 reaches 546/546 and 13/13, so it remains the lowest reliable globally fixed deterministic reference.",
  "route_action_zh": "不得通过把 reference 降到 K15 来主张调用减少。下一候选必须是物理上不同、只读部署可见观测与几何的 warm initializer，并在匹配 K16 最终精度时严格减少 A 和 A^T；之后才允许资源、外部和真实 BOST 门。",
  "route_action_en": "Do not claim call reduction by weakening the reference to K15. The next candidate must be a physically distinct warm initializer that reads only deployment-visible observations and geometry, matches K16 final accuracy, and strictly reduces both A and A^T before resource, external, or real-BOST gates can open.",
